aragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085220/extras/768739825adf7a376857449a82afcbf6.webp?t=1729500878\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joy, sadness and everything in between. Figment 2: Creed Valley draws from emotional experiences that affect us all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face stress, anxiety and the fear of the dark in a musical and surreal universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sword and restore the light that once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085220/extras/39e5da9d4b703a026c5a3109e5c045ca.poster.avif?t=1729500878\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085220/extras/39e5da9d4b703a026c5a3109e5c045ca.webm?t=1729500878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figment 2: Creed Valley is the standalone sequel to Figment.</strong></p>","developers":["Bedtime Digital Games"],"dlc":[2356900],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085220/header.jpg?t=1729500878","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Bedtime Digital Games ApS. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1085220/538015/f2caf112eb8da8039067e299595fcfd5cbabebaf/1751186342/dash_av1.mpd?t=1683192088","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1085220/538015/f2caf112eb8da8039067e299595fcfd5cbab